<view class="page membership-page">
  <view class="card hero-card">
    <view class="brand-mark">熵盾</view>
    <view class="hero-title">会员权益</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">交易之前，先用熵盾看风险。开通会员，把风控规则执行落地。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card current-card {{current.isMember ? 'is-member' : 'is-guest'}}">
    <view class="current-row">
      <text class="current-label">当前状态</text>
      <text class="current-value">{{current.levelText}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{current.isMember && current.expireText}}" class="current-row">
      <text class="current-label">到期时间</text>
      <text class="current-value">{{current.expireText}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{current.isMember}}" class="current-row">
      <text class="current-label">加强版</text>
      <text class="current-value">{{current.advancedEnabled ? '已开通' : '未包含'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!current.isMember}}" class="current-tip">
      未开通会员，可使用稳健版免费测算次数。开通任一会员即可解锁完整风控工具。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">选择开通方式</view>
    <view class="section-sub">所有套餐均提供风险测算、规则工具与风险管理支持，不构成投资建议。</view>

    <view
      wx:for="{{plans}}"
      wx:key="key"
      class="plan-card {{item.highlight ? 'plan-highlight' : ''}}"
      data-key="{{item.key}}"
      bindtap="onChoosePlan"
    >
      <view wx:if="{{item.highlight}}" class="plan-flag">推荐</view>
      <view class="plan-head">
        <view class="plan-name">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="plan-price">
          <text class="price-num">¥{{item.amountText}}</text>
          <text class="price-cycle">/ {{item.cycleText}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="plan-rights">{{item.rightsText}}</view>
      <view class="plan-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
      <view class="plan-action">选择并开通 ›</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card notice-card">
    <view class="notice-title">关于权益与服务</view>
    <view class="notice-item">· 会员权益以服务端确认结果为准，支付完成后将在本机同步。</view>
    <view class="notice-item">· 风险测算结果基于你的输入参数，仅作风险管理参考。</view>
    <view class="notice-item">· 熵盾提供风险工具与规则支持，不构成任何投资建议。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer-actions">
    <button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="goCalculator">先去免费测算</button>
    <button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="goBack">返回</button>
  </view>
</view>
